        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Upon the expiration of the 2003 CWA/BEW/Lucent National Memorandum of Understanding (\"2003 MOU\"), the agreement in that MOU extending application of the retiree medical caps past the expiration of the 2003 MOU has been terminated and its obligations are no longer binding upon the Company or the Unions. The parties agree that this 2004 Memorandum of Understanding agreement on postretirement medical and dental benefits fully supersedes and replaces all prior oral or written agreements among the parties with respect to postretirement medical and dental benefits.",
            "block_bbox": [
